nutes. Our crew is trained to create a relaxed environment—we chat before rolling, do multiple takes without pressure, and focus on natural conversation rather than a scripted read. Most clients find the experience easier than they expected and often enjoy it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we script what the customer says, or should it be authentic?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Authentic always performs better. We provide talking points and questions to guide the conversation, but the customer's own words—their phrasing, examples, and emotion—are what make testimonials credible and memorable. Scripted testimonials feel forced and audiences can tell the difference immediately.\"}}]}]}"}></script>
